  "top10": {
    "introHtml": "Top 10 picks for a cheap, fun 4-seat convertible near Media, PA \u2014 refreshed Sep 4, 2026. 39 Cars.com, 21 CarGurus, and 38 AutoTrader results searched; 2-seat roadsters (Miata, Boxster, SLK, etc.) and personal excludes filtered out, leaving 41 qualifying listings. Ranked by condition over miles: low-mileage standouts, reliable model families, and sourcing diversity. TrueCar skipped (body-style filter broken). Note: several AutoTrader listings lack location/distance data \u2014 call dealer to confirm proximity.",
    "picks": [
      {
        "rank": 1,
        "year": 2008,
        "make": "BMW",
        "model": "135i",
        "trim": "Convertible",
        "price": 12995,
        "mileage": 48371,
        "location": null,
        "distanceMi": null,
        "url": "https://www.autotrader.com/cars-for-sale/vehicle/790118095",
        "dealer": "Premier Auto Group",
        "source": "autotrader",
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": null,
        "imageUrl": "https://images.autotrader.com/hn/c/48e6e5f8e26f4c9ab27d9520494927ca.jpg",
        "whyGood": "The 2008 BMW 135i Convertible is the standout buy on this list. The twin-turbo N54 inline-6 produces 300 hp \u2014 more grunt than anything else here. At only 48,371 miles this car is practically fresh; most E88 135is have 100K+ by now. The 1-series was BMW's last truly driver-focused small convertible before the brand went upmarket. Four actual seats (tight in back, as BMW intended). Transmission shows null \u2014 call Premier Auto Group to confirm manual vs. SMG.",
        "whatToVerify": "Full top cycle test, headliner water stains (1-series soft tops are leak-prone). N54 engine: check for boost pipe cracks, charge pipe issues, water pump (thermostat housing), injector seals. High-pressure fuel pump rattle on cold start. Pull codes for HPFP. Verify SMG or 6MT \u2014 if 6MT, check clutch engagement height. Rocker seam for rust bubbles.",
        "bottomLine": "Best mechanical value in the pool \u2014 a low-mile twin-turbo driver's machine at a fair price."
      },
      {
        "rank": 2,
        "year": 2001,
        "make": "Mercedes-Benz",
        "model": "CLK-Class",
        "trim": "Base",
        "price": 12940,
        "mileage": 34866,
        "location": "Willow Grove, PA",
        "distanceMi": 23,
        "url": "https://www.cars.com/vehicledetail/618db3d8-7315-4e33-a78a-7051f0d06591/",
        "dealer": "Selden Motors",
        "source": "cars.com",
        "dealRating": "Great Deal",
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://platform.cstatic-images.com/large/in/v2/41500c3b-0278-565b-b8aa-8a53ec151e79/b6a20b1a-33b2-4e54-8623-a2400db3503e/KKA8lQVqFTelfR3UEOoMD48kSOU.jpg",
        "whyGood": "Only 34,866 miles on a 2001 \u2014 that's extraordinary. The CLK Cabriolet (W208) is a proper 2+2 with an elegant design that aged beautifully. Cars.com rates it a Great Deal, clean title, no accidents. Selden Motors in Willow Grove is a known dealer. Low-mileage European convertibles at $13K are rare; this one's been coddled. AutoTrader shows the same car at $12,450 (listed as CLK 430) \u2014 compare before buying.",
        "whatToVerify": "Full top operation cycle (open/close twice, check headliner for water staining, check rear plastic window for crazing). M112 V6 or M113 V8 \u2014 check for oil leaks at valve covers and rear main. Rust under rear wheel arches and sill plates. Subframe mounts on 20+ year cars. A/C compressor function.",
        "bottomLine": "Exceptional mileage for the year \u2014 a well-preserved classic that's still genuinely usable."
      },
      {
        "rank": 3,
        "year": 2011,
        "make": "Audi",
        "model": "S5",
        "trim": "3.0 Premium Plus",
        "price": 13642,
        "mileage": 69156,
        "location": "Haddon Township, NJ",
        "distanceMi": 18,
        "url": "https://www.cars.com/vehicledetail/dabcb463-e945-41fc-b07c-dd08637d350a/",
        "dealer": "Royal Auto Group",
        "source": "cars.com",
        "dealRating": "Fair Deal",
        "transmission": null,
        "imageUrl": "https://platform.cstatic-images.com/large/in/v2/220992f4-6d7b-5a84-999a-0c3c413cdc94/564cee7d-5505-4712-8a54-7f364740f431/TWUJbSHF9Ip8hGWCmQukBmMLH-E.jpg",
        "whyGood": "The only Audi S5 Cabriolet in the pool \u2014 a supercharged 3.0T V6 (333 hp) with quattro AWD. The B8 S5 Cab is rare, sporty, and makes every competitor here look ordinary. 69K miles is low for a 2011. Clean title, no accidents. Transmission shows null \u2014 the B8 S5 Cab came in 6-speed manual or S tronic; confirm with dealer. If it's a 6MT this rises to #1.",
        "whatToVerify": "Top cycle full operation. Supercharger belt tensioner wear (common on 3.0T). Oil consumption check \u2014 do a consumption test. DSG/S tronic fluid if auto; clutch engagement if manual. Rear differential fluid. Check for bent subframe from curb strikes. Quattro transfer case operation.",
        "bottomLine": "Rarest and most exciting driver's car in the pool \u2014 a supercharged quattro Cabriolet at a sensible price."
      },
      {
        "rank": 4,
        "year": 1995,
        "make": "Jaguar",
        "model": "XJS",
        "trim": "2+2",
        "price": 9649,
        "mileage": 46103,
        "location": "Magnolia, NJ",
        "distanceMi": 21,
        "url": "https://www.cars.com/vehicledetail/11a59567-1e64-4f4b-a04a-6708a153e1ad/",
        "dealer": "Avi Auto Sales",
        "source": "cars.com",
        "dealRating": "Great Deal",
        "transmission": null,
        "imageUrl": "https://platform.cstatic-images.com/large/in/v2/2a9ff44c-1d8c-572a-b85a-e2c017e560ce/eec71dc7-9fe7-4cbe-86f1-4f071ac06ac8/5WgTTGYREAi4bO4kfEPlo0Ncpmw.jpg",
        "whyGood": "Only 46,103 miles on a 1995 XJS \u2014 this car has barely been driven. The XJS 2+2 Convertible is a true classic British grand tourer with genuine rear seats (tight but real). Great Deal rating, clean title, no accidents. Avi Auto Sales in Magnolia NJ also has it on AutoTrader at $8,750 \u2014 use that as a negotiating anchor. The 4.0L AJ6 inline-6 is smooth and proven.",
        "whatToVerify": "Top mechanism full cycle \u2014 XJS convertible tops are complex and seal repairs are expensive. Rear window delamination. Lucas electrics: check all switches, windows, A/C compressor. Coolant system (thermostat housing, hoses). Rear subframe rubber mounts (known wear item). Check top hydraulic rams for weeping seals.",
        "bottomLine": "A stunning low-mile classic for the price \u2014 beautiful if the top is intact; budget for electrical quirks."
      },
      {
        "rank": 5,
        "year": 1994,
        "make": "Pontiac",
        "model": "Firebird",
        "trim": "Trans Am GT",
        "price": 14900,
        "mileage": 33887,
        "location": "Vineland, NJ",
        "distanceMi": 35,
        "url": "https://www.cars.com/vehicledetail/66709a08-2ab1-4622-a63e-0c08dfbfb7a2/",
        "dealer": "Perfection Auto Sales",
        "source": "cars.com",
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": null,
        "imageUrl": "https://platform.cstatic-images.com/large/in/v2/0181f6bf-f47f-4436-9dc2-6adfb9485030/28ffe544-ab16-4bfe-94ec-6cc5ee576230/B74VCLxrQLKrAC8ii33GfsIfkjM.jpg",
        "whyGood": "Only 33,887 miles \u2014 the lowest-mileage car on this entire list. A 1994 Trans Am GT with a 5.7L LT1 V8, T-tops not a soft top (technically a targa/convertible hybrid). Real American muscle, 2+2 seating. These are appreciating now. Transmission unknown \u2014 confirm manual (T-56 6-speed) or automatic (4L60E); manual preferred. At 35mi out it's worth the trip if condition matches the low odometer.",
        "whatToVerify": "Top/T-top panel seal condition, headliner. LT1 reverse-flow cooling system \u2014 check thermostat function, coolant flush history. Optispark distributor (common failure on LT1). 4L60E or T-56 \u2014 both solid but check for slippage. Check for rust along rocker panels and rear quarters (common on F-bodies). Rear hatch seal.",
        "bottomLine": "Lowest-mileage car in the pool \u2014 a genuine American classic if the top and mechanicals check out."
      },
      {
        "rank": 6,
        "year": 2006,
        "make": "BMW",
        "model": "3 Series",
        "trim": "330Ci Convertible RWD",
        "price": 9055,
        "mileage": 84220,
        "location": null,
        "distanceMi": null,
        "url": "https://www.cargurus.com/details/457820101",
        "dealer": null,
        "source": "cargurus",
        "dealRating": "Good Deal",
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://static.cargurus.com/images/forsale/2026/09/02/12/31/2006_bmw_3_series-pic-172918236714367791-1024x768.jpeg",
        "whyGood": "The E46 330Ci Cabriolet is widely regarded as one of the best driver's cars BMW ever built. The naturally aspirated 3.0L inline-6 is smooth, reliable, and tuneable. Good Deal at $9,055 with 84K miles. The last year of E46 production makes this a sweet spot \u2014 modern enough to use daily but analog enough to be fun. 2+2 seating.",
        "whatToVerify": "Top full cycle \u2014 E46 soft tops are well-engineered but check the rear window for delamination and the hydraulic pump (under trunk). Oil leaks from valve cover gasket and oil filter housing gasket. Coolant system (DISA valve, thermostat, water pump). Rear subframe reinforcement (very important on E46 \u2014 check for cracks around subframe mounting points).",
        "bottomLine": "Classic driver's car at a bargain price \u2014 the E46 330Ci Cabriolet remains a benchmark."
      },
      {
        "rank": 7,
        "year": 2012,
        "make": "Ford",
        "model": "Mustang",
        "trim": "GT",
        "price": 14998,
        "mileage": 117500,
        "location": "Broomall, PA",
        "distanceMi": 5,
        "url": "https://www.cars.com/vehicledetail/643c102f-1be6-4c08-852b-68c88a733768/",
        "dealer": null,
        "source": "cars.com",
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": null,
        "imageUrl": "https://platform.cstatic-images.com/large/in/v2/p2p/2f463666-65ff-4c53-8367-e86d91c119c6/54cfe51c-4dc4-42fe-8959-26b8dbef36e5",
        "whyGood": "V8 Mustang GT at $15K and only 5 miles away. The 2012 S197 with the 5.0 Coyote V8 (412 hp) is a screaming deal. 117K miles is manageable on the Coyote \u2014 these engines are robust. 2+2 seating. Clean title, no accidents. Confirm manual (MT-82) vs. automatic; if it's a 6MT this is an even better buy.",
        "whatToVerify": "Top full cycle, headliner and rear seat water staining. Coyote: check for oil leaks, timing chain guides. MT-82 if manual \u2014 check 3rd gear synchro (known weak point). 8.8 rear axle clunk on takeoff (gear backlash). Spring perch rust. IRS subframe bolts. Verify convertible top motor operation.",
        "bottomLine": "Best Mustang value in the pool \u2014 a V8 GT practically in your backyard."
      },
      {
        "rank": 8,
        "year": 2020,
        "make": "Ford",
        "model": "Mustang",
        "trim": "EcoBoost Premium Convertible RWD",
        "price": 13485,
        "mileage": 132770,
        "location": null,
        "distanceMi": null,
        "url": "https://www.cargurus.com/details/453908300",
        "dealer": null,
        "source": "cargurus",
        "dealRating": "Good Deal",
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://static.cargurus.com/images/forsale/2026/08/19/05/26/2020_ford_mustang-pic-7479190532907237465-1024x768.jpeg",
        "whyGood": "Newest car in the pool at $13,485. The 2020 S550 EcoBoost is the most refined, tech-rich Mustang here \u2014 independent rear suspension, modern safety features, CarPlay. Good Deal rating. The 2.3T four-cylinder is peppy and gets reasonable fuel economy. 132K miles is high but the S550 drivetrain is solid. Great daily driver.",
        "whatToVerify": "Top full cycle \u2014 check powered soft top operation, rear window camera function. EcoBoost: check coolant for oil contamination (head gasket), intercooler pipe for cracks. MT-82 if manual (confirm transmission). Check rear camera for blur/moisture. S550 convertible rear seat water stains. CarPlay/sync functionality.",
        "bottomLine": "Most modern car in the pool at a good price \u2014 sacrifice V8 rumble for a far more complete daily driver."
      },
      {
        "rank": 9,
        "year": 2013,
        "make": "Mercedes-Benz",
        "model": "E 350",
        "trim": "Cabriolet",
        "price": 9995,
        "mileage": 119433,
        "location": null,
        "distanceMi": null,
        "url": "https://www.autotrader.com/cars-for-sale/vehicle/780885942",
        "dealer": "Premier Motor Group",
        "source": "autotrader",
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.autotrader.com/hn/c/071a50b6344449bba249af4004ea6477.jpg",
        "whyGood": "The W207 E-Class Cabriolet is arguably the most elegant 4-seat convertible ever built. The 3.5L V6 produces 302 hp and pairs perfectly with the 7G-Tronic auto. At $9,995 with 119K miles this is genuine luxury for the price. Premier Motor Group in Spring City PA. Clean/no-accident history (cars.com). Appears on multiple sites confirming it's a real listing.",
        "whatToVerify": "Full top cycle \u2014 the ABC (Active Body Control) or standard soft top rams; check for hydraulic leaks. Check for rust on lower door sills. M272 V6: balance shaft gear wear on early units (check service history). Air suspension if equipped. Rear window delamination. Panoramic roof function if equipped. Check all AMG appearance package switches.",
        "bottomLine": "Best luxury value in the pool \u2014 proper 4-seat cabriolet with genuine Mercedes refinement under $10K."
      },
      {
        "rank": 10,
        "year": 2016,
        "make": "Audi",
        "model": "A5",
        "trim": "2.0T Premium",
        "price": 10990,
        "mileage": 111747,
        "location": null,
        "distanceMi": null,
        "url": "https://www.autotrader.com/cars-for-sale/vehicle/788048178",
        "dealer": "Divan Auto Group",
        "source": "autotrader",
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.autotrader.com/hn/c/e8bca0cd3ab843a2bd264ac1164e8c29.jpg",
        "whyGood": "The B8.5 A5 Cabriolet is a sharp, modern 4-seat convertible with quattro AWD and Audi's well-regarded 2.0T TFSI four-cylinder. 2016 model puts it in the fresh-enough category. $10,990 is fair for an A5 Cab of this vintage. The CarGurus listing of the same car (455895318, same mileage) shows a Good Deal at $11,480 \u2014 Divan's $10,990 beats it.",
